Subject: [PATCH 07740/11362] [outer-loop] ARC fix plan_in_model regression +
 structured-nav-model live solve (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5841)

Digging into the 2026-07-20 induction-quality diagnosis's open question (perfect model
-> 0 level-up), found a REGRESSION: _components_detailed was widened to a 5-tuple in
2f0760307, but _model_candidates (plan_in_model) still unpacked 4 -> ValueError on any
grid with components -> silently disabled E3's world-model planner for object-bearing
games. Fixed defensively (*_). 2 regression tests.

Downstream win: with the fix + a structured InducedNavWorldModel (correct-by-construction
nav model, not LLM induction), plan_in_model finds a real navigation plan that reaches a
REAL tu93 level-up. plan_in_model plans in imagination + executes once from reset ->
sidesteps the non-idempotent-reset blocker -> live-compatible.

